'''Riot-848''' is {{WF|Temple}}'s [[Signature Weapon|signature]] machine pistol which is modified by [[Albrecht Entrati]] to recall bullets upon reloading, causing the bullets to explode dealing {{D|Blast}} damage as they fly back into the gun's chamber.

==Characteristics==
*The primary fire deals pure {{D|Puncture}} damage.
*Bullets lodge into surfaces. Upon reloading, the bullets explode in a '''1.5''' meter radius before flying back to the wielder.
**Recall explosion deals {{D|Blast}} damage.
**Explosion does not need direct line of sight to deal damage and will penetrate walls.
**Does not inflict [[Stagger|self-stagger]].
**Can benefit from {{M|Fulmination}} ({{M|Primed Fulmination|Primed}}).
**A maximum of '''32''' rounds can be embedded at any given time. Additional rounds will cause the earliest round to automatically detonate and fly back ''without'' reloading the gun.
**Reloading while holstered effects such as {{M|Eject Magazine}} does not trigger explosions.
*Does not use ammo pickups.

{{Advantages|}}
{{Disadvantages|
*Explosion has a [[Enemy Body Parts|headshot]] multiplier of 1x and cannot trigger headshot conditions.
*Explosion has linear [[Damage Falloff]] from 100% to 50% from central impact.}}

